    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocated on the southern periphery of Derra Bog, this attractive 1.78-acre (0.72-hectare) plot, contained within Folio KY12439F, offers a peaceful and unique opportunity in a tranquil rural setting. The lands are situated along the Sive Walk, approximately 3 km west of Listowel town.\n\nThe property would be ideally suited to nature lovers and those seeking space for leisure and outdoor pursuits, with direct proximity to the natural walking trail.\n\nThe lands may offer potential for a range of small-scale recreational and horticultural uses, including polytunnels, beehives, vegetable plots and keeping small livestock.\n\nProviding an excellent opportunity to support local biodiversity, with areas of natural habitat that can provide shelter and food for local birds, bees, wildflowers and other wildlife.\n\nServices: The lands are unserviced, with no water or electricity connection currently available."
      },
